mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course is an important professional curriculum for undergraduate students major in Clinic Pharmacy. After study, students should master the major principle and theory of Medicinal Chemistry, and comprehend structure-activity relationships, structure-metabolism relationships, structure-toxicity relationships and drug incompatibility by learning of the structure types and the development history of classical drugs. Moreover, the drug action should mechanism be well understood in view of chemistry and molecular level. Important typical drugs are also well learned according to their chemical structures and therapeutic activities.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
